            "SeoDescription": "Rectangular Connectors include a wide variety of connector solutions for power, data, and signal applications. As the name implies, they are rectangular in shape and can provide ease to the design process. Many of the most commonly found connectors and connector accessories fall into this category.",
            "ChildCategories": [
              {
                "CategoryId": 314,
